``` Traceline parameterized template. <PLACEHOLDERS> are filled in by the generator page. ```
``` Lines marked [JSON-A] or [JSON-B] are alternatives: the page emits one set, depending on the JSON extraction mode. ```
``` A placeholder that renders empty removes its whole line. ```

``` ---------- 0. Base search ---------- ```
index IN (<INDEX>) earliest=<TIME_EARLIEST> latest=<TIME_LATEST>
(
       (<LAYER_1_SOURCE> <LAYER_1_MATCH>)
    OR (<LAYER_2_SOURCE> <LAYER_2_MATCH>)
    OR (<LAYER_3_SOURCE> <LAYER_3_MATCH>)
    OR (<LAYER_4_SOURCE> <LAYER_4_MATCH>)
)

``` ---------- 1. Layer: deepest layer is checked first, as in the original (Host before WS) ---------- ```
| eval LayerName=case(
    match(_raw, "<LAYER_4_MATCH_REGEX>"), "<LAYER_4_NAME>",
    match(_raw, "<LAYER_3_MATCH_REGEX>"), "<LAYER_3_NAME>",
    match(_raw, "<LAYER_2_MATCH_REGEX>"), "<LAYER_2_NAME>",
    match(_raw, "<LAYER_1_MATCH_REGEX>"), "<LAYER_1_NAME>")
| where isnotnull(LayerName)
| eval Layer=case(LayerName="<LAYER_1_NAME>",1, LayerName="<LAYER_2_NAME>",2, LayerName="<LAYER_3_NAME>",3, LayerName="<LAYER_4_NAME>",4)

``` ---------- 2. JSON fields (eComm and Enterprise only) ---------- ```
``` [JSON-B] rex + json_extract: when the sourcetype has no JSON extraction, or the JSON follows a text prefix ```
| rex field=_raw "<JSON_BLOB_REGEX>"
| eval JsonBlob=if(in(Layer, <JSON_LAYER_LIST>), JsonBlob, null())
| eval JsonOK=if(isnotnull(JsonBlob), if(json_valid(JsonBlob), 1, 0), null())
| eval sidJson=json_extract(JsonBlob, "<JSON_SESSION_PATH>"),
       TxnJson=json_extract(JsonBlob, "<JSON_TXNREF_PATH>"),
       EndpointJson=json_extract(JsonBlob, "<JSON_ENDPOINT_PATH>"),
       DirJson=json_extract(JsonBlob, "<JSON_DIRECTION_PATH>"),
       HttpStatus=json_extract(JsonBlob, "<JSON_HTTPSTATUS_PATH>"),
       RespCode=json_extract(JsonBlob, "<JSON_RESPCODE_PATH>"),
       ErrCode=json_extract(JsonBlob, "<JSON_ERRCODE_PATH>"),
       ErrDesc=json_extract(JsonBlob, "<JSON_ERRDESC_PATH>")
``` [JSON-A] direct field access: when INDEXED_EXTRACTIONS=json or KV_MODE=json already extracts the fields ```
``` | eval JsonOK=if(in(Layer, <JSON_LAYER_LIST>), 1, null()) ```
``` | eval sidJson=mvindex('<JSON_SESSION_PATH>', 0), TxnJson=mvindex('<JSON_TXNREF_PATH>', 0), ... same for every path ```

``` ---------- 3. Direction ---------- ```
| eval Direction=case(
    <LAYER_1_DIRECTION_RULE>,
    <LAYER_2_DIRECTION_RULE>,
    <LAYER_3_DIRECTION_RULE>,
    <LAYER_4_DIRECTION_RULE>)
| where isnotnull(Direction)

``` ---------- 4. Session and link keys ---------- ```
<LAYER_1_SID_RULE>
<LAYER_2_SID_RULE>
<LAYER_3_SID_RULE>
<LAYER_4_SID_RULE>
| eval sessionId=coalesce(<SID_FIELDS>)
| rex field=_raw "(?:transactionReferenceNumber|transactionRef)\s*:\s*(?<transactionRef>[^\"]+)"
| eval transactionRef=coalesce(TxnJson, transactionRef)
| rex field=_raw "<HOST_LINK_REGEX>"
| eval LinkKey=coalesce(transactionRef, hostRef)
| rex field=_raw "(?<sidAny>[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12})"
| eventstats first(sessionId) as sidViaLink by LinkKey
| eval LinkedBy=case(isnotnull(sessionId),"sessionId", isnotnull(sidViaLink),"LinkKey", isnotnull(sidAny),"any-UUID", true(),"none")
| eval sessionId=coalesce(sessionId, sidViaLink, sidAny, "unlinked")
| search sessionId IN (<SESSION_ID>)

``` ---------- 5. Endpoint, URL, service codes ---------- ```
<LAYER_1_ENDPOINT_RULE>
<LAYER_2_ENDPOINT_RULE>
<LAYER_3_ENDPOINT_RULE>
<LAYER_4_ENDPOINT_RULE>
| where LayerName!="<LAYER_4_NAME>" OR mvcount(SvcCode)>=1

``` ---------- 6. HopStatus (per response event) ---------- ```
<WS_STATUS_RULE>
<HOST_STATUS_RULE>
| eval HostBad=mvmap(HostStatus, if(in(HostStatus, <HOST_SUCCESS_VALUES>), null(), HostStatus))
| eval HopStatus=case(
    Direction="Request", "N/A",
    JsonOK=0, "UNKNOWN",
    isnotnull(HttpStatus) AND NOT in(tostring(HttpStatus), <HTTP_SUCCESS_LIST>), "FAILED",
    len(trim(ErrCode))>0 AND NOT in(ErrCode, <SUCCESS_CODE_LIST>), "FAILED",
    len(trim(ErrDesc))>0, "FAILED",
    match(_raw, "<FAIL_PATTERN>"), "FAILED",
    isnotnull(HostBad), "FAILED",
    isnotnull(RespCode), if(in(RespCode, <SUCCESS_CODE_LIST>), "SUCCESS", "FAILED"),
    isnotnull(HostStatus), "SUCCESS",
    isnotnull(WsStatus), if(in(WsStatus, <HTTP_SUCCESS_LIST>, <SUCCESS_CODE_LIST>), "SUCCESS", "FAILED"),
    isnotnull(HttpStatus), "SUCCESS",
    true(), "UNKNOWN")
| eval RespCode=coalesce(RespCode, WsStatus, mvjoin(HostStatus, ","))

``` ---------- 7. Order, pairing, elapsed time, missing responses ---------- ```
| eval SortKey=if(Direction="Request", Layer, -Layer)
| sort 0 sessionId _time SortKey
| streamstats count as Step by sessionId
| eval WsURL=if(LayerName="<LAYER_3_NAME>", URL, null())
| streamstats last(WsURL) as LastWsURL by sessionId
| eval pairIndex=mvrange(0, ceil(mvcount(SvcCode)/2))
| eval HostPairs=mvmap(pairIndex,
    mvindex(SvcCode, pairIndex*2) . " ~ " .
    coalesce(mvindex(SvcCode, (pairIndex*2)+1), mvindex(SvcCode, pairIndex*2)))
| eval HostServices=if(LayerName="<LAYER_4_NAME>", mvjoin(HostPairs, " | "), null())
| eval API=case(
    LayerName="<LAYER_1_NAME>", Endpoint,
    LayerName="<LAYER_2_NAME>", Endpoint,
    LayerName="<LAYER_3_NAME>", coalesce(URL, LastWsURL, EnterpriseEndpoint, "N/A"),
    LayerName="<LAYER_4_NAME>", EnterpriseEndpoint)
| eval PairKey=case(
    LayerName="<LAYER_4_NAME>", coalesce(mvindex(SvcCode, 0), EnterpriseEndpoint, ""),
    true(), replace(API, "(?i)(Request|Response)$", ""))
| eval ReqTime=if(Direction="Request", _time, null())
| streamstats last(ReqTime) as LastReqTime by sessionId Layer PairKey
| eval ElapsedMs=if(Direction="Response" AND isnotnull(LastReqTime),
    round((_time-LastReqTime)*1000, 0), null())
| eventstats count(eval(Direction="Request")) as nReq count(eval(Direction="Response")) as nResp by sessionId Layer PairKey
| eval RespMissing=if(Direction="Request" AND nResp<nReq, 1, 0)

``` ---------- 8. SessionStatus and FirstFailedHop (per sessionId) ---------- ```
| eventstats min(Layer) as EntryLayer by sessionId
| eval EntryResult=if(Layer=EntryLayer AND Direction="Response", HopStatus, null()),
       FailTime=if(HopStatus="FAILED", _time, null())
| eventstats count(eval(HopStatus="FAILED")) as FailedHops
             count(eval(HopStatus="UNKNOWN")) as UnknownHops
             sum(RespMissing) as MissingResponses
             values(EntryResult) as EntryResults
             min(FailTime) as FirstFailTime
             by sessionId
| eval SessionStatus=case(
    isnotnull(mvfind(EntryResults, "^FAILED$")), "FAILED",
    FailedHops>0 AND isnotnull(mvfind(EntryResults, "^SUCCESS$")), "PARTIAL",
    FailedHops>0, "FAILED",
    UnknownHops>0 OR MissingResponses>0 OR isnull(EntryResults), "UNKNOWN",
    true(), "SUCCESS")
| eval FailHop=if(HopStatus="FAILED" AND _time=FirstFailTime, LayerName . ": " . API, null())
| eventstats first(FailHop) as FirstFailedHop by sessionId

``` ---------- 9. Result filter ---------- ```
<ONLY_FAILED>

``` ---------- 10. Display ---------- ```
| eval DirectionSymbol=if(Direction="Request", "?", "!")
| eval Indent=if(Layer=1, "", substr("------------------------------", 1, 4*Layer-6) . "› ")
| eval Flow=Indent . LayerName . ": " . coalesce(API, "N/A") . " [" . DirectionSymbol . "]"
| eval Params=if(len(trim(transactionRef))>0, "TxnRefNo: " . transactionRef, null())
| eval EventTime=strftime(_time, "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%3N")
| table <OUTPUT_COLUMNS>
